# FlowCare Frontend Environment Configuration

# Optional: Override the API base endpoint if running frontend on a separate server.
# By default, FlowCare automatically connects to:
# - Development: /api (proxied to local XAMPP)
# - Production on flowcare.great-site.net: current protocol //flowcare.great-site.net/api
# - External / Decoupled: https://flowcare.great-site.net/api
#
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://flowcare.great-site.net/api
